 red [[Cookbook:Chilli|chilli]], cut into small pieces\n* 2 cans (200 g) [[Cookbook:Crab|crab]], drained\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Scallion|scallion]], cut into 1 [[Cookbook:Centimetre (cm)|cm]] pieces\n* 1 plate (500 g) cooked [[Cookbook:Rice|rice]]\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Fish sauce|fish sauce]]\n* 1 tbsp [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* 1 tbsp [[Cookbook:pepper|black pepper]]\n\n==Procedure==\n\n# [[Cookbook:Stir-frying|Stir fry]] the crab in the 5 tbsp oil for 1 minute. Remove from the heat, and reserve.\n# Heat the remaining oil, and use to stir fry the garlic, red onion, scallion, and red chillies for 1 minute until fragrant.\n# Add the fried crab and bean sprouts. Stir until the crab changes color.\n# Add the rice, fish sauce, salt, and black pepper. Stir until well-mixed.\n# Serve hot.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using rice]]\n[[Category:Recipes for fried rice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using crab]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bean sprout]]\n[[Category:Recipes using fish sauce]]\n[[Category:Pescatarian recipes]]\n[[Category:Halal recipes]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Crab Fried Rice","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":"5","ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"5 tbsp olive oil","sourceText":"5 tbsp olive oil","amountText":"5 tbsp olive oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"2 cloves garlic, minced","sourceText":"2 cloves garlic, minced","amountText":"2 cloves garlic, minced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"2 cloves red onion, sliced","sourceText":"2 cloves red onion, sliced","amountText":"2 cloves red onion, sliced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"150 g bean sprouts, soaked in hot water","sourceText":"150 g bean sprouts, soaked in hot water","amountText":"150 g bean sprouts, soaked in hot water","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"2 big red chilli, cut into small pieces","sourceText":"2 big red 